{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Football is full of hidden talent \u2014 and it\u2019s your job to find it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build an academy by finding them early, developing them properly, and selling at the right moment so you can grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You scout youth matches to reveal real ability, sign the prospects that fit, train with clear focus, upgrade your facilities, and reinvest through transfers. Every decision feeds the next step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/2afb26973fa6efa51f562aba0d72823b.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout youth players</strong> \u2014 watch match simulations, reveal skills and traits over time, and sign the right prospects into your academy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop talent</strong> \u2014 set focused training (e.g., Stamina, Vision, Finishing) and let match minutes turn potential into progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your academy</strong> \u2014 improve facilities to speed development and raise your prestige.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell players</strong> \u2014 move graduates on to interested clubs and fund the next wave of prospects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize leagues and players</strong> \u2014 edit competitions, clubs, and player names to shape your own football world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/3187d17436d768de9e1d10abb4100bba.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/31831500d9edb88c078f47bf80666654.poster.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1040 height=1155 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/31831500d9edb88c078f47bf80666654.webm?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the structure of your football world. Edit leagues, clubs, and player names to reflect real competitions, create fictional setups, or adjust details to your preference. Every change integrates seamlessly, allowing you to manage within a system built the way you want it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/5bf54fee821b403303ae6c9abb1aab0d.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9a0286a3a2757d9db61140252603e86f.poster.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9a0286a3a2757d9db61140252603e86f.webm?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9a0286a3a2757d9db61140252603e86f.mp4?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow games from the sidelines as key moments unfold \u2014 goals, chances, cards, swings in form. Performances shape your assessment: strengths stand out, gaps become clear, and a player\u2019s stock rises or settles based on what happens on the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/7b428fb97a5cc19aec793bb61f73b9cf.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/5fd8b0d4e46eb528cdc427887eaf5a3d.poster.avif?t=1760258600\" width=910 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/5fd8b0d4e46eb528cdc427887eaf5a3d.webm?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/5fd8b0d4e46eb528cdc427887eaf5a3d.mp4?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose who to watch and come back until the picture is solid. Hidden attributes become visible, consistency (or the lack of it) shows up, and the rough outline turns into a real profile. When a prospect fits, you make the offer and bring them into the academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/ae4600a68504b612945559b2e8ec0ff5.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/266d8656fab584d4e2ff64674f66d8ed.poster.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/266d8656fab584d4e2ff64674f66d8ed.webm?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/266d8656fab584d4e2ff64674f66d8ed.mp4?t=1760258600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start modest and improve with intent. Facility upgrades sharpen training and recovery and lift your prestige, opening the door to stronger opposition and better development paths. Step by step, your academy becomes the place where potential turns into output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/f37d5dd65808f4c872c29cadef8da13a.avif?t=1760258600\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is targeted, not vague. You set the focus, earn progress through minutes, and see steady gains across seasons. When the time is right, you sell \u2014 not for clauses or bonuses, just a clean move that funds your next signing and the next upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1760258600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1760258600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/d7ed898f31b5b2baa65015a8f2e05d88fcc54ce4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760258600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/d7ed898f31b5b2baa65015a8f2e05d88fcc54ce4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760258600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","